aph", "text": "Biofeedback: This uses sensors to help you see how your body reacts to stress. It can help you learn to manage certain body functions to reduce symptoms.", "runs": [{"text": "Biofeedback: This uses sensors to help you see how"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "your"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "body"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "reacts"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "stress."}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "It"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "can"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "help"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "you"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "learn to manage certain body functions to reduce "}, {"text": "symptoms."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "320"}}, {"id": "body-27576", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Physical therapy: This may improve movement and coordination. It also encourages better movement patterns and prevents muscle weakness.", "runs": [{"text": "Physical"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "therapy:"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "This"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "may"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "improve"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "movement"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and coordination. It also encourages better movement patterns and prevents muscle weakness."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "320"}}, {"id": "body-27577", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Medication: This treatment may help if the patient has depression, anxiety or chronic pain.", "runs": [{"text": "Medication: This treatment may help if the patient has depression, anxiety or chronic pain."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "320"}}, {"id": "body-27580", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading2", "text": "Wernicke’s Encephalopathy", "runs": [{"text": "Wernicke’s"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Encephalopathy"}], "level": 2, "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "359"}}, {"id": "body-27581", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Wernicke’s Encephalopathy (WE) is an acute neuropsychiatric syndrome that results from thiamine deficiency. It is linked to significant morbidity and mortality. If untreated, it can progress to Korsakoff Syndrome, which is characterized by a disproportionate impairment in memory compared to other cognitive functions. Common causes include a staple diet of unpolished rice, chronic alcohol abuse, malnutrition, recurrent vomiting and diarrhoea, gastrointestinal surgery, magnesium deficiency, unbalanced nutrition, cancer, and chemotherapeutic treatments.", "runs": [{"text": "Wernicke’s Encephalopathy (WE) is an acute neuropsychiatric syndrome that results from thiamine deficiency. It is linked to significant morbidity and mortality. If untreated, it can progress to Korsakoff Syndrome, which is characterized by a disproportionate impairment in memory compared to other cognitive functions. Common causes include a staple diet of unpolished rice, chronic alcohol abuse, malnutrition, recurrent vomiting and diarrhoea, gastrointestinal surgery, magnesium deficiency, unbalanced nutrition, cancer, and chemotherapeutic treatments."}]}, {"id": "body-27583", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Clinical presentation", "runs": [{"text": "Clinical"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "presentation"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-27584", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "May present with relatively non-specific Common symptoms or signs include:", "runs": [{"text": "May"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "present"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "relatively"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "non-specific"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Common"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "symptoms"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "signs"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "include:"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "319"}}, {"id": "body-27585", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Ocular abnormalities", "runs": [{"text": "Ocular"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "abnormalities"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "319"}}, {"id"